# kanzonaspdf
===
 A FOREVER free, opensource alternative for Bluebeam Revu, PDF-XChange Editor and Adobe Acrobat Pro on Windows and Linux. Markups, stamps, measuring, signatures, forms, OCR, redaction, page tools and editing of a PDF’s own text and objects. Fast on large CAD sheets. Installer or portable. Spanish support.
